ますが筆が乗るように自由にやって頂いて構いません\nファーストインプレッションでデザインしていただけましたらありがたいです\n不明な点や作画カロリー高すぎる点、こうしたほうが良くなると思いましたら\n先生の描きやすいように解釈・アレンジしていただいて大丈夫です\n\nお忙しい中とは存じますが、ご一考の程お願いします\n\nhttps://twitter.com/toridamono/status/1593184622166540288?s=46&t=cUa50rbYrZUVwMLD8aUePg", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 17501, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "月代", "screen_name": "bs_sakayaki", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1707682140383834112/OEdR5UCM.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/76016362/1764520943/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 506675, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "あお＠C108 15日(土) ケ-55『NAVY CHOCOLLATE』", "screen_name": "aocooler", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2062814856596889600/81zwjuUX.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/217298991/1500385242/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 9, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 708490, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "河野(kouno)", "screen_name": "ma_sa_o", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/997729690772099072/Q2XGzEvS.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/14832289/1547060489/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_